label.text:
Applies to ${[template.productName || (template.productId ? template.productId : ''),
                                template.categoryName ? 'category ' + template.categoryName : '', template.facilityName ?
                                'at ' + template.facilityName : ''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ') || 'any product'} in ${
                                template.contextText}

${template.stageText} inspection, sample on ${template.sampleBasisText.toLowerCase()}${
                                template.attachedText ? ', attached to the ' + template.attachedText : ''}. A released work
                                order's gate keeps the template as of its release.
